  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_whasshing_betelle_cb3eecec2f2c27e504e4d804f319ef51ca01f6462aac45cbc54113f3336c2164d1">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>beetle: an implement with a wooden head and a handle, used for driving wedges, ramming down paving stones etc. (OED s.v. beetle n.1 1); hence washing betelles are such used for beating (washing) clothes</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
